16
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:48,920
Just a little bit.

17
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:49,680
Is this okay?

18
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:50,400
Okay.

19
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:56,400
It's chewier than Xinjiang's naan.

20
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:57,960
Pizza is just naan with toppings on it.

21
00:00:58,760 --> 00:00:59,880
Isn't this just stir-fried corn noodles?

22
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:04,319
Do you know
what stir-fried corn noodles are?

23
00:01:04,319 --> 00:01:04,959
Yes, I know.

24
00:01:04,959 --> 00:01:05,480
It's that one.

25
00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:05,920
That one, right?

26
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:07,480
I've never even heard of it.

27
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,360
What are stir-fried corn noodles?

28
00:01:08,615 --> 00:01:09,440
(Need an explanation)

29
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:10,640
Haven't you
ever had stir-fried corn noodles?

30
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,680
What on earth is that?

31
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,680
That name sounds so weird.

32
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:15,520
Which one?

33
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:18,040
It's noodles pressed from cornmeal.

34
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:19,480
Which dish looks like it?

35
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:19,760
This one.

36
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:21,960
Stir-fried corn noodles.

37
00:01:21,960 --> 00:01:22,960
Cut it out.

38
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:24,720
It totally doesn't fit your boss vibe.

39
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:26,760
First thing in the morning,

40
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:27,920
get me a plate
of stir-fried corn noodles.

41
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,000
It sounds like "stir-fried fool".

42
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:33,560
Stir-fried fool.

43
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,480
And another bowl of "boiled idiot".

44
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:44,000
This beef is really tasty.

45
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:46,280
The dipping sauce for this beef
is amazing.

46
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:50,120
We've got a great place to stay.

47
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:51,920
Our room

48
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:52,920
