49
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:53,840
but very cozy.

50
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,560
We are just like a married couple.

51
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,440
(Feeling heating up fast)
You know.

52
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:05,440
Now, let's move on
to our post-meal mission.

53
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:07,812
(Show-off singer-dancer)
Among the eight members, there are two show-offs.

54
00:02:07,812 --> 00:02:09,800
Everyone must stay inside the circle
made of tissues,

55
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:10,560
singing, dancing, and moving together.

56
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,320
Within the time limit,

57
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:12,840
without breaking the tissue,

58
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:14,120
reach the designated photographing spot,

59
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:15,960
and take photos as required.

60
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,760
Each round gives you
5 photographing attempts.

61
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:19,320
Successfully taking 3 required photos

62
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:20,160
means completing the mission,

63
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:22,200
or winning by finding the show-offs.

64
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:24,000
The show-offs win
by sabotaging the mission

65
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,480
and keeping their roles hidden.

66
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:26,920
Let's draw your roles first.

67
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:27,280
Let's go.

68
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:28,000
I'll go first.

69
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,120
Okay, let's draw.

70
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:34,600
Everyone, three, two, one,

71
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:35,400
