72
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:39,160
Please show your cards to the camera.

73
00:02:41,488 --> 00:02:42,995
(The show-off of this round)

74
00:02:43,198 --> 00:02:45,000
Three, two, one, open your eyes.

75
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:45,378
(Flexing facial muscles)

76
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:47,800
Okay, round one,

77
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:48,720
