78
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:49,760
(Show-offs: Guo Jingfei, Wang Yuwen)
Now...

79
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:52,240
(Keeping it a mystery)
The show-offs won't recognize one another now?

80
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,560
Are you trying to find your teammate?

81
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,000
(Testing if you are my teammate)

82
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,160
I'm a Good Person.

83
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,280
I got mesmerized. Sorry.

84
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,120
Come on.

85
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,280
What hand gesture should we do?

86
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,960
Puppy ears.

87
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:06,520
Like this.

88
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:07,960
Like this.

89
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,000
Like this.

90
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,960
Puppy ears.

91
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:10,640
Puppy ears.

92
00:03:11,873 --> 00:03:13,305
(Show-off singer-dancer,
Round 1 of Game 1)

93
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:16,680
Lin Yi.

94
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,520
Don't move too much.

95
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:19,640
Jump gently.

96
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:21,560
Camera 3, Yuning in the center position.

97
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,000
