116
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,840
(Truly an accident)
Honestly, it was an accident.

117
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,720
(Secretly delighted)
He's not even pretending anymore.

118
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,400
