124
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:07,360
I don't think it's Naiwen.

125
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,240
It's definitely not me.

126
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:08,840
Right.

127
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:09,760
Because this round,

128
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:11,440
