131
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,279
He knows he has a teammate.

132
00:04:16,279 --> 00:04:17,160
Besides, he was standing at the joint.

133
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,560
This obvious move

134
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:19,920
