140
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,200
(Wow The World S1 EP7 Part 2)
How about this?

141
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,400
Let's vote for Chen Xingxu.

142
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:31,840
