from the beginning.

167
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,440
(Seizing the chance to clear herself)
It really wasn't me.

168
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:09,520
But can you tell which side

169
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:10,080
