171
00:05:12,577 --> 00:05:14,565
(Just my own fault)

172
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,920
Then I think Honglei is suspicious.

173
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:16,840
(Seizing the moment to shift blame)
I was right behind him.

174
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:17,800
He couldn't possibly see me dancing.

175
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,520
