197
00:05:54,840 --> 00:05:56,440
I can lock onto Honglei too.

198
00:05:56,781 --> 00:05:58,240
I think we should vote for Honglei.

199
00:05:58,680 --> 00:05:59,080
(The tide shifting again)
Right.

200
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:01,720
Round one.

201
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,720
