213
00:06:19,278 --> 00:06:21,180
(Lin Yi, Lin Yi, Lin Yi, Sun Honglei, Sun Honglei,
Wang Yuwen, Sun Honglei, Sun Honglei)

214
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,480
I think it's you.

215
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:24,600
