Okay.

216
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,040
It's fine.

217
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:25,680
Honglei.

218
00:06:25,776 --> 00:06:26,631
(Can't believe it)

219
00:06:26,631 --> 00:06:27,785
(Sun Honglei out)

220
00:06:28,598 --> 00:06:29,837
(How could this happen?)

221
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:30,760
Honglei.

222
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,640
Honglei's role is...

223
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:36,880
Good Person.

224
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:37,360
See.

225
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,360
- See.
- See.

226
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:38,880
See.

