229
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:42,440
I did.

230
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:42,920
So what?

231
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,800
I voted for him.

232
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,640
It's definitely among those four.

233
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,400
Of course.

234
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:49,920
Four.

235
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,120
There are two show-offs.

236
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,560
You picked four out of seven,

237
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,280
