238
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:55,120
The three of us
are most likely innocent.

239
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:55,800
Come on.

240
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,000
For this round, you guys discuss

241
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,200
