242
00:06:58,200 --> 00:06:58,960
Xingxu.

243
00:06:58,960 --> 00:06:59,480
You do it.

244
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,080
I'll do it.

245
00:07:00,222 --> 00:07:01,323
(Show-off singer-dancer,
Round 2 of Game 1)

246
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,680
Come on, let's dance, Lin Yi.

247
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:09,640
Camera 3,
Zhou Ye in the center position.

248
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:11,640
