253
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:17,440
Let me see who it really is.

254
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:18,600
Let me see who it is.
There is surveillance here.

255
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:19,480
Okay.

256
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,120
Okay.

257
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:21,160
Okay, come on.

258
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,480
Get behind me, then come over.

259
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,560
Walk forward.

260
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,600
