285
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,680
Who didn't move?

286
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:04,560
(Catching the key detail)
Who behind you didn't move?

287
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,600
Someone definitely didn't move,

288
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:06,480
