289
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,960
So it was Xingxu behind you.

290
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:08,560
(Caught in the crossfire again)

291
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,440
How could I...

292
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:11,760
I was holding onto the tissues, right?

293
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:12,920
Then who was behind you?

294
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:13,840
Me.

295
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:14,480
(Randomly picking the next show-off)
