311
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:42,679
You need to...

312
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:45,240
First of all, I was keeping up closely.

313
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:47,920
Unless that key person in the middle

314
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:50,000
