for everyone behind.

316
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,240
I think it's Lin Yi.

317
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:53,958
(The only one who's been brainwashed)

318
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:56,520
I didn't have any physical contact
with any of you.

319
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:58,120
