325
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:06,920
I touched it. I did touch it.

326
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:07,760
My leg was right there.

327
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,360
But I'm not sure

328
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:11,240
