329
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,160
I think that's how it was.

330
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:14,160
(Accidentally pinpoints the teammate)
Because no one else touched it.

331
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:16,480
Your move was too aggressive.

332
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:17,840
You can't frame a Good Person like this,

333
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,480
(Putting up one last fight)
so blatantly

334
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,240
