335
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,440
Let's vote.

336
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,520
Everyone, start voting.

337
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:25,000
Three, two, one, please vote.

338
00:09:25,144 --> 00:09:26,213
(Guo Jingfei, Guo Jingfei, Guo Jingfei,
Lin Yi, Lin Yi, Guo Jingfei, Guo Jingfei)

339
00:09:26,213 --> 00:09:26,800
