No.

348
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,000
You got five votes.

349
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:38,760
Five votes for me?

350
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:39,800
Young people.

351
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:40,400
You guys

352
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:41,640
