353
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,080
You're the next one, right?

354
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,280
Both of you voted for me.

355
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:47,640
Fei's role is...

356
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:48,347
