Okay.

399
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,040
Okay.

400
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,080
How about this?

401
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,640
Let's face each other, okay?

402
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:45,160
Okay.

403
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:45,720
Okay.

404
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:46,200
Okay.

405
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:48,480
Three, two, one. Music, start.

406
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:56,360
I feel like it's reaching my heel.

407
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,440
It's about to snap.

408
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:58,320
It's fine. I take a step forward.

409
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:00,120
This is a bit too...

410
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,800
I feel like I can't make it.

411
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:03,640
Camera 1, Yuning in the center position.

412
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:04,160
Okay, it's fine.

413
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:04,960
It's fine.

414
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:05,680
He can do it.

415
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:07,000
- I'll step back first.
- Move backward.

416
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:07,400
You don't need to step back.

417
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:07,760
No need to step back.

418
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:09,320
- No, Yuning and Xingxu go first.
- Go.

419
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:09,760
Go.

420
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:10,600
Small steps.

421
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,560
Don't stick your bottom out.

422
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:13,280
(About to fall off)
It fell to the floor.

423
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:14,200
It's fine.

424
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:15,560
Get to that spot.

425
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,560
Get to that spot.

426
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:17,400
You have to get over there.

427
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:18,080
Naiwen.

428
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:19,480
Don't do that.

429
00:11:19,560 --> 00:11:20,080
But he...

430
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:20,960
Okay, that's good. We're set.

431
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,200
Turn sideways a bit.

432
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:22,520
Come on.

433
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:23,320
No need to turn sideways.

434
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:23,960
This is good.

435
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:24,560
- Come on.
- Swap, you two.

436
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:25,528
- Swap spots.
- Come on.

437
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,480
Make puppy ears.

438
00:11:28,713 --> 00:11:29,547
(Emergency adjustment)

439
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,481
