Camera 3, Yuwen in the center position.

440
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:33,080
More?

441
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:34,280
Camera 3.

442
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:34,800
How about this?

443
00:11:34,800 --> 00:11:35,680
Keep an eye on each other,

444
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:36,600
