445
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,040
Okay.

446
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:37,800
Okay, let's go.

447
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,040
Move.

448
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:40,031
(Shuffling forward)

449
00:11:40,031 --> 00:11:40,440
Move.

450
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:42,320
Move.

451
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:43,560
Don't nudge me.

452
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:44,040
Don't nudge me.

453
