472
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:15,840
He's stepping on it.

473
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,360
He didn't do it on purpose.

474
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,040
It was totally accidental.

475
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:20,120
He knows I was being careful all along.

476
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:21,440
I was being careful too.

477
00:12:23,743 --> 00:12:24,680
