501
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:08,000
I said it earlier.

502
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,120
I said

503
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:13,240
the tissue

504
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:15,000
