if you snapped it on your first step?

513
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:30,600
I'm not that smart.

514
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:33,000
(Can't hold back)
I'd rather finish the mission quickly.

515
00:13:33,520 --> 00:13:34,600
He's an open book.

516
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:35,640
So I'd try my best to...

517
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:45,400
Do you like it?

518
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:50,000
Do you think it was an accident
or on purpose?

519
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:51,360
I don't think it was an accident.

520
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:53,360
Not an accident.

521
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:55,160
I think it should not be Xingxu.

522
00:13:55,160 --> 00:13:57,840
Knowing him,

523
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:58,880
he's the type that

524
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:01,000
even if this mission failed,

525
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:01,960
he probably wouldn't

526
00:14:02,912 --> 00:14:05,120
