527
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:06,880
He is extremely timid.

528
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:10,480
No.

529
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:11,680
In my heart, he is

530
00:14:11,680 --> 00:14:13,360
