531
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:15,951
I don't think it was snapped on purpose.

532
00:14:15,951 --> 00:14:16,440
Because I...

533
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,080
An accident.

534
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:18,080
I think it looks like an accident.

535
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:19,880
Because when Yuwen snapped it,

536
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:20,880
