537
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:21,840
Because I was right behind Yuwen.

538
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:22,720
Her head was turned like this.

539
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:23,760
She couldn't see this side.

540
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:24,920
And then it snapped.

541
