00:38:08,960 --> 00:38:10,502
- No wonder I couldn't dodge you anyway.
- Okay.

1383
00:38:10,502 --> 00:38:11,956
Then tell me, since I was behind you,

1384
00:38:11,956 --> 00:38:13,920
where could I go
not to be blocked by you?

1385
00:38:13,920 --> 00:38:15,000
Right there in the back now.

1386
00:38:15,000 --> 00:38:15,942
You just needed to be a little taller.

1387
00:38:15,942 --> 00:38:17,800
Yes. Raise your hand a bit higher
and it would've worked.

1388
00:38:21,639 --> 00:38:22,943
(Still room to stand here)

1389
00:38:33,600 --> 00:38:34,600
Circle silently.

1390
00:38:36,080 --> 00:38:37,160
I also think it was Yuning.

1391
00:38:37,160 --> 00:38:38,440
No. Listen.

1392
00:38:38,440 --> 00:38:40,240
When I first stood here,

1393
00:38:40,240 --> 00:38:41,582
it could already capture me.

1394
00:38:41,582 --> 00:38:42,982
But she suddenly stood up,

1395
00:38:42,982 --> 00:38:44,840
found a spot, and blocked me.

1396
00:38:44,840 --> 00:38:46,000
Then you should stand up too.

1397
00:38:46,000 --> 00:38:47,280
Stand up!

1398
00:38:47,280 --> 00:38:47,800
I stand up?

1399
00:38:47,800 --> 00:38:48,680
I'm only this tall.

1400
00:38:49,440 --> 00:38:50,560
You're not taller than Wang Yuwen?

1401
00:38:57,880 --> 00:38:59,440
Whatever.

1402
00:38:59,440 --> 00:39:01,040
(Tactical evasion)
Whatever.

1403
00:39:03,117 --> 00:39:05,169
Let's hear what Yuning has to say.

1404
00:39:05,169 --> 00:39:05,960
I don't know.

1405
00:39:05,960 --> 00:39:06,840
What I want to say is,

1406
00:39:06,840 --> 00:39:08,680
you couldn't really tell anyway.

1407
00:39:08,680 --> 00:39:10,320
So there's no need for me
to expose myself here.

1408
00:39:10,320 --> 00:39:11,280
If I were a bad guy,

1409
00:39:11,280 --> 00:39:13,240
for something so simple,

1410
00:39:13,240 --> 00:39:14,440
I wouldn't pull tricks here.

1411
00:39:14,440 --> 00:39:15,680
Then who do you think it is?

1412
00:39:15,680 --> 00:39:16,440
I think it's her.

1413
00:39:16,440 --> 00:39:17,120
It's definitely her.

1414
00:39:17,120 --> 00:39:17,880
(Blame falls out of the blue)
You think it's Yuwen?

1415
00:39:17,880 --> 00:39:18,320
Yes.

1416
00:39:19,760 --> 00:39:21,320
But Yuwen looks fine in this one.

1417
00:39:21,320 --> 00:39:22,200
Of course, she does.

1418
00:39:22,200 --> 00:39:22,720
Because

1419
00:39:22,720 --> 00:39:24,674
I think the photo
is just one of the clues.

1420
00:39:24,674 --> 00:39:25,720
The second is the

1421
00:39:25,720 --> 00:39:26,640
mental state.

1422
00:39:29,000 --> 00:39:30,000
What state was I in?

1423
00:39:33,400 --> 00:39:34,400
She was thinking,

1424
00:39:34,400 --> 00:39:35,400
"What should I do?

1425
00:39:35,400 --> 00:39:36,840
What do I do next?"

1426
00:39:36,840 --> 00:39:37,920
She did look

1427
00:39:37,920 --> 00:39:38,546
- a bit empty.
- A bit empty.

1428
00:39:38,546 --> 00:39:40,000
Deep down, she was actually numb.

1429
00:39:40,840 --> 00:39:42,280
She did look a bit empty.

1430
00:39:42,280 --> 00:39:43,160
Indeed.

1431
00:39:43,160 --> 00:39:44,280
Her acting was so good.

1432
00:39:44,280 --> 00:39:46,280
There's no way
her gaze would be this empty.

1433
00:39:46,800 --> 00:39:47,800
I was totally checked out.

1434
00:39:47,800 --> 00:39:48,600
Totally numb.

1435
00:39:49,160 --> 00:39:50,227
Can we look at Yuwen's previous photo?

1436
00:39:50,227 --> 00:39:51,280
Her face wasn't in the previous one.

1437
00:39:51,606 --> 00:39:52,320
This one.

1438
00:39:52,800 --> 00:39:54,139
- Zoom in.
- That seems to make sense.

1439
00:39:54,139 --> 00:39:55,480
Zoom in.

1440
00:39:57,067 --> 00:39:58,119
Empty, dazed.

1441
00:39:59,080 --> 00:40:00,600
So unfamiliar.

1442
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:04,760
In this photo,

1443
00:40:04,760 --> 00:40:06,240
her expression here was,

1444
00:40:06,240 --> 00:40:08,040
"What do I do next round?"

1445
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:10,240
This is the one
where she figured it out.

1446
00:40:12,520 --> 00:40:13,400
And this one...

1447
00:40:13,400 --> 00:40:14,760
She was really not empty here.

1448
00:40:14,760 --> 00:40:17,363
(Then what is it?)

1449
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:18,760
About to win.

1450
00:40:23,640 --> 00:40:25,160
She was even smiling a bit.

1451
00:40:28,640 --> 00:40:30,120
I'm kind of convinced now too.

1452
00:40:37,160 --> 00:40:38,160
She couldn't even hide her smile.

1453
00:40:38,160 --> 00:40:38,640
No.

1454
00:40:39,600 --> 00:40:40,600
It really wasn't me.

1455
00:40:41,560 --> 00:40:42,160
It really wasn't me.

1456
00:40:43,240 --> 00:40:44,520
Vote for me, and you'll lose.

1457
00:40:44,520 --> 00:40:46,920
I think Yuwen is super suspicious.

1458
00:40:46,920 --> 00:40:47,640
Really suspicious.

1459
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:50,000
Especially there was a slip-up

1460
00:40:50,000 --> 00:40:50,960
in what she just said.

1461
00:40:50,960 --> 00:40:52,600
"Vote for me, and you'll lose."

1462
00:40:55,207 --> 00:40:56,000
Logically, it should be,

1463
00:40:56,000 --> 00:40:57,560
"Vote for me, and we'll lose."

1464
00:40:59,247 --> 00:40:59,720
Right?

1465
00:40:59,824 --> 00:41:00,968
(Oh, my God)

1466
00:41:00,968 --> 00:41:03,200
It's got to be you.

1467
00:41:04,880 --> 00:41:06,320
That was definitely
a slip of the tongue.

1468
00:41:08,440 --> 00:41:10,040
It really wasn't me!

1469
00:41:10,040 --> 00:41:11,320
How could it be me?

1470
00:41:11,840 --> 00:41:13,440
(Watching from the shadows)
Couldn't suppress my smile.

1471
00:41:15,200 --> 00:41:16,600
But she's feeling awkward right now.

1472
00:41:16,600 --> 00:41:17,160
(Hands that won't stop)

1473
00:41:17,160 --> 00:41:18,240
Yuwen is feeling awkward now.

1474
00:41:18,240 --> 00:41:19,286
- Who?
- Yuwen.

1475
00:41:19,757 --> 00:41:20,680
She's super embarrassed.

1476
00:41:20,680 --> 00:41:22,450
- It's so obvious. Look at her.
- Look. She's rubbing her hands.

1477
00:41:22,952 --> 00:41:24,160
It really wasn't me.

1478
00:41:26,360 --> 00:41:27,840
Before drawing the cards this round,

1479
00:41:27,840 --> 00:41:28,713
she asked me a question.

1480
00:41:28,713 --> 00:41:29,840
She said,

1481
00:41:29,840 --> 00:41:31,520
"Once we draw your role,

1482
00:41:31,520 --> 00:41:32,840
how do we stay calm,

1483
00:41:33,360 --> 00:41:34,360
and play it cool?"

1484
00:41:34,360 --> 00:41:35,840
I said, "Just forget about it."

1485
00:41:36,480 --> 00:41:37,120
And she did it.

1486
00:41:39,440 --> 00:41:40,880
She forgot everything.
Look at this expression.

1487
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:44,274
In this one, she remembered.

1488
00:41:44,274 --> 00:41:44,920
I remembered in this one,

1489
00:41:44,920 --> 00:41:46,120
(Out of options)
"I'm about to win."

1490
00:41:46,200 --> 00:41:47,600
Come on.

1491
00:41:47,600 --> 00:41:48,360
Three,

1492
00:41:48,360 --> 00:41:49,120
two,

1493
00:41:49,120 --> 00:41:49,680
one.

1494
00:41:49,680 --> 00:41:50,280
Please vote.

1495
00:41:50,376 --> 00:41:52,640
(Unanimous vote for Wang Yuwen)

1496
00:41:52,640 --> 00:41:54,960
A unanimous vote against Yuwen!

1497
00:41:57,080 --> 00:41:58,280
Yuwen's role is...

1498
00:42:03,600 --> 00:42:04,360
Good Person.

1499
00:42:08,120 --> 00:42:09,240
So they lost, right?

1500
00:42:09,240 --> 00:42:09,880
Yes.

1501
00:42:09,880 --> 00:42:10,280
Lost.

1502
00:42:10,280 --> 00:42:11,560
You've already lost.

1503
00:42:11,560 --> 00:42:13,240
The winners come out to rub salt.

1504
00:42:13,240 --> 00:42:14,760
Rubbing salt in our wounds,

1505
00:42:14,760 --> 00:42:15,560
right?

1506
00:42:16,880 --> 00:42:18,200
Three, two, one.

1507
00:42:18,200 --> 00:42:19,080
Music, start.

1508
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:24,680
This rhythm feels like Yuning.

1509
00:42:25,677 --> 00:42:26,724
Go now.

1510
00:42:26,724 --> 00:42:27,520
Please.

1511
00:42:28,520 --> 00:42:29,160
It's not Zhou Ye?

1512
00:42:29,160 --> 00:42:29,800
Yuning?

1513
00:42:36,600 --> 00:42:37,480
Well played!

1514
00:42:37,480 --> 00:42:38,240
So good!

1515
00:42:43,000 --> 00:42:44,560
Liu Yuning!

1516
00:42:44,615 --> 00:42:45,663
(My bad)

1517
00:42:46,000 --> 00:42:47,320
Awesome!

1518
00:42:47,320 --> 00:42:49,360
Fooled us all with just one sentence.

1519
00:42:49,360 --> 00:42:50,800
How did you change your minds?

1520
00:42:50,800 --> 00:42:52,200
The half-face and this one...

1521
00:42:52,200 --> 00:42:52,880
Yeah.

1522
00:42:52,880 --> 00:42:53,880
They served the same purpose.

1523
00:42:53,880 --> 00:42:55,720
How could you vote for Yuwen?

1524
00:42:55,720 --> 00:42:57,120
Exactly!

1525
00:42:57,400 --> 00:42:59,000
The three of us look like idiots.

1526
00:43:00,240 --> 00:43:01,170
But he really didn't look like

1527
00:43:01,170 --> 00:43:02,068
he took a bad shot on purpose.

1528
00:43:02,068 --> 00:43:03,720
We were dead set on him at the end.

1529
00:43:03,720 --> 00:43:05,800
- Yet you voted for me instead.
- Yeah.

1530
00:43:05,800 --> 00:43:06,960
I really

1531
00:43:06,960 --> 00:43:09,000
had a part in stirring things up too.

1532
00:43:09,400 --> 00:43:10,160
Yeah.

1533
00:43:12,960 --> 00:43:14,600
(Lemon Queen 2.0)
Let's play some mind games.

1534
00:43:14,600 --> 00:43:16,400
What if we still win this round, right?

1535
00:43:16,760 --> 00:43:18,000
That's basically impossible.

1536
00:43:18,000 --> 00:43:20,200
Actually, we just
wanted Zhou Ye to experience

1537
00:43:20,200 --> 00:43:21,440
that we three Ferraris,

1538
00:43:21,440 --> 00:43:21,960
even when old,

1539
00:43:21,960 --> 00:43:22,720
are not bad.

1540
00:43:23,240 --> 00:43:24,440
Do you need us to go easy on you?

1541
00:43:24,520 --> 00:43:25,880
Thanks, Yuning, for going easy on us.

1542
00:43:25,880 --> 00:43:26,360
Alright.

1543
00:43:26,628 --> 00:43:28,120
Don't lose too fast, okay?

1544
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:31,127
So what if we use our seniority?

1545
00:43:31,127 --> 00:43:32,320
That's our advantage.

1546
00:43:32,480 --> 00:43:33,480
Then who is our queen?

1547
00:43:33,480 --> 00:43:34,440
Come on.

1548
00:43:34,440 --> 00:43:35,520
Let's head to the town

1549
00:43:35,520 --> 00:43:36,560
and have a showdown.

1550
00:43:36,800 --> 00:43:37,720
Go take a rest.

1551
00:43:37,720 --> 00:43:39,040
Your stamina is clearly lacking.

1552
00:43:39,480 --> 00:43:41,280
He's talking really tough.

1553
00:43:41,590 --> 00:43:42,456
Come out!

1554
00:43:42,456 --> 00:43:43,640
Come over here!

1555
00:43:43,800 --> 00:43:44,358
Is it you?

1556
00:43:48,879 --> 00:43:50,400
Stop arguing, guys!

1557
00:43:50,400 --> 00:43:51,920
Strike now.

1558
00:43:55,580 --> 00:43:57,940
♪Turns out that meeting you♪

1559
00:43:57,940 --> 00:44:00,628
♪Is the joy hidden in the world♪

1560
00:44:00,628 --> 00:44:03,179
♪We still have to experience together♪

1561
00:44:03,179 --> 00:44:05,882
♪Exploring the novelty of the world♪

1562
00:44:05,882 --> 00:44:08,341
♪This is our wonderful encounter♪

1563
00:44:08,341 --> 00:44:10,852
♪I find good scenery
for you along the way♪

1564
00:44:10,852 --> 00:44:12,947
